WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.890
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.160 --> 01:41.640
[Episode 5]

3
01:47.980 --> 01:49.160
Please.

4
01:56.820 --> 01:58.913
- Bye, Master Chang Xuan. - Take care.

5
02:00.540 --> 02:01.740
Let's go.

6
02:02.599 --> 02:04.040
Where did they go last night?

7
02:04.040 --> 02:05.359
Do you even need to ask?

8
02:05.359 --> 02:07.426
Only Master Chang Xuan could pull that off.

9
02:10.860 --> 02:12.280
Miss Zi Yi.

10
02:13.080 --> 02:14.573
Miss Zi Yi.

11
02:17.500 --> 02:19.293
Why are you crying?

12
02:20.540 --> 02:23.000
You two talk. I'll wait in the car.

13
02:26.960 --> 02:29.460
It's about Master Chang Xuan, isn't it?

14
02:30.640 --> 02:32.980
Can we talk in private? Come with me.

15
02:37.260 --> 02:40.733
Don't you think Master Chang Xuan has been acting strange?

16
02:42.540 --> 02:46.600
It's all because of you.

17
02:48.920 --> 02:50.813
Just say what's on your mind.

18
02:52.120 --> 02:53.240
Alright.

19
02:53.240 --> 02:58.259
Look, Miss Ye doesn't put on airs.

20
02:58.259 --> 02:59.540
She's meek and obedient.

21
02:59.540 --> 03:02.013
That's how she wins a man's heart.

22
03:02.420 --> 03:04.080
What are you getting at?

23
03:04.080 --> 03:07.540
You want me to be submissive? Not a chance.

24
03:07.540 --> 03:08.757
That's not what I meant.

25
03:08.757 --> 03:10.240
There are other ways to be gentle.

26
03:10.240 --> 03:14.279
For example, catering to his interests.

27
03:14.279 --> 03:16.620
That's a subtler kind of gentleness.

28
03:16.620 --> 03:20.724
Make him feel that you're the woman who understands him best.

29
03:20.724 --> 03:23.204
Look, at his party yesterday,

30
03:23.204 --> 03:25.300
he said he liked Miss Ye's gift the most.

31
03:25.300 --> 03:28.160
Actually, he wasn't impressed by anyone's gift.

32
03:28.160 --> 03:30.600
Think about the Yu family. Rich and powerful.

33
03:30.600 --> 03:32.584
What could he possibly lack?

34
03:32.584 --> 03:37.000
But if you give him something that truly touches his heart,

35
03:37.313 --> 03:39.286
it'll make all the difference.

36
03:42.000 --> 03:43.370
Then tell me.

37
03:43.370 --> 03:46.133
What gift would truly touch his heart?

38
03:47.340 --> 03:49.259
Let me think.

39
03:49.259 --> 03:50.800
What could it be?

40
03:55.760 --> 03:57.300
Actually, there's one thing.

41
03:57.620 --> 04:00.106
He really wants it, but can't get it.

42
04:00.106 --> 04:01.500
Tell me.

43
04:02.020 --> 04:04.600
I only happened to hear him mention it once.

44
04:04.600 --> 04:06.520
He thinks this place is too small.

45
04:06.520 --> 04:08.844
He wants to build a grander racetrack.

46
04:08.844 --> 04:11.060
Ten times the size of this one.

47
04:11.060 --> 04:14.264
Somewhere like Shuangqiao Town,

48
04:14.264 --> 04:17.360
Yanxi Lake, or Mount Changping.

49
04:22.160 --> 04:24.540
Keep going. We're almost there.

50
04:32.420 --> 04:33.639
Out of the way!

51
04:33.639 --> 04:34.899
Move aside!

52
04:35.560 --> 04:38.300
- The soldiers are coming! - Move aside!

53
04:38.300 --> 04:40.040
Mom!

54
04:49.840 --> 04:52.446
Hurry. Commander-in-Chief is waiting for me!

55
04:59.480 --> 05:01.700
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

56
05:01.700 --> 05:04.904
Master Cheng has convened a conference with other provinces in Huaijing.

57
05:04.904 --> 05:10.053
Whether he or Prime Minister Rui will take the presidency should soon be decided.

58
05:13.012 --> 05:17.686
The date of our alliance with Governor Chu's army has also been set.

59
05:18.212 --> 05:20.377
We will fully support Master Cheng.

60
05:20.377 --> 05:21.540
But...

61
05:21.540 --> 05:24.660
[Zhang Xiao Xian] Governor Chu wants the 9th Corps,

62
05:24.660 --> 05:27.630
[Brigade Commander, 3rd Army Corps] the most elite force of our Yu Army.

63
05:27.630 --> 05:32.620
Since we've made the decision, we'll give it our all.

64
05:37.080 --> 05:39.640
Commander-in-Chief, Brigade Commander Feng has arrived.

65
05:39.640 --> 05:42.040
- Brigade Commander Feng. - That was fast.

66
05:42.040 --> 05:43.800
[Feng San Li, Brigade Commander, 2nd Army Corps] Brother!

67
05:43.800 --> 05:46.400
- Feng the Bold. - Brother.

68
05:46.400 --> 05:49.160
- I've been waiting for you. - I've missed you so much.

69
05:49.976 --> 05:52.240
Long time no see. You look better than ever.

70
05:52.240 --> 05:54.660
Others spent years dealing with those notorious bandits.

71
05:54.660 --> 05:57.800
You wiped them all out in just six months.

72
05:57.800 --> 05:59.820
- You've done us proud. - Brother.

73
05:59.820 --> 06:03.440
Guess what I've brought you.

74
06:03.440 --> 06:04.977
- What is it? - Look.

75
06:04.977 --> 06:07.320
- Top-grade Fenjiu Liquor. - Good.

76
06:07.320 --> 06:10.220
- Let's get drunk tonight. - Alright.

77
06:10.220 --> 06:12.077
- At my place-- - Brigade Commander Feng.

78
06:12.077 --> 06:14.819
Commander-in-Chief is in a meeting.

79
06:21.340 --> 06:24.981
You pester my big brother into one meeting after another.

80
06:25.740 --> 06:27.160
I'd like to ask,

81
06:27.160 --> 06:32.080
will your reports and meetings bring peace to the world?

82
06:33.880 --> 06:36.266
If you were sent to the battlefield,

83
06:36.266 --> 06:42.319
I bet you'd be so scared that you'd wet your pants.

84
06:48.080 --> 06:49.393
Feng the Bold.

85
06:49.860 --> 06:50.860
Brother.

86
06:54.280 --> 06:58.486
Feng has been with me for over 20 years.

87
06:58.860 --> 07:00.860
We've faced death together.

88
07:00.860 --> 07:04.160
He's covered in scars and bullet wounds.

89
07:04.780 --> 07:08.941
But he still can't shake his bandit-like manner.

90
07:11.279 --> 07:12.920
Please forgive him.

91
07:14.420 --> 07:16.946
Go change your clothes.

92
07:17.279 --> 07:20.473
I can already smell your sour sweat.

93
07:23.740 --> 07:24.830
Go on.

94
07:24.830 --> 07:26.353
Alright.

95
07:32.940 --> 07:35.579
Master Chang Xuan, you're finally awake.

96
07:35.579 --> 07:37.600
All that smashing noise couldn't even wake you.

97
07:37.600 --> 07:39.480
You slept right through it.

98
07:39.480 --> 07:41.153
Morning, Mom.

99
07:42.380 --> 07:43.520
You're awake.

100
07:43.520 --> 07:45.910
Try some freshly made walnut cake.

101
07:45.910 --> 07:48.253
Don't you have duties in the army today?

102
07:48.900 --> 07:50.683
Jin Xuan, don't tease me.

103
07:50.683 --> 07:53.564
Father only sent me to the 9th Corps to gain some experience for a few years.

104
07:53.564 --> 07:55.840
I haven't been given any important duties yet.

105
07:55.840 --> 07:57.406
It's a waste of time anyway.

106
08:01.360 --> 08:05.283
You invited Miss Zi Yi to your birthday party.

107
08:05.283 --> 08:08.660
How are things between you two?

108
08:09.780 --> 08:11.646
Everyone I invited is just a friend.

109
08:11.976 --> 08:16.780
Friend? Your party is more like a revolving door of entertainers.

110
08:16.780 --> 08:19.523
Everyone takes their turns on stage.

111
08:19.523 --> 08:22.480
As soon as you send one away, another shows up.

112
08:22.480 --> 08:25.560
Mom, don't worry about him.

113
08:25.560 --> 08:28.450
Look at Young Marshal Xiao from Beixin.

114
08:28.450 --> 08:31.800
He led his troops into battle himself and won at Huyang Pass.

115
08:31.800 --> 08:34.880
He even took Yuhua and Tonglin against all odds.

116
08:34.880 --> 08:37.180
Three victories made him renowned throughout Jiangbei.

117
08:37.180 --> 08:38.380
Now look at yourself.

118
08:38.380 --> 08:42.480
You're only a year or two apart, yet you're worlds apart.

119
08:42.480 --> 08:46.559
It seems you have fallen for this fellow Xiao.

120
08:47.340 --> 08:51.059
Since you like him so much, why not arrange a marriage with his family?

121
08:51.059 --> 08:52.559
I'd love that.

122
08:52.559 --> 08:56.360
But I heard he keeps a lady hidden away at his residence.

123
08:56.360 --> 08:58.100
I wonder if he'd even give you a glance.

124
08:59.440 --> 09:01.080
Yu Chang Xuan.

125
09:01.080 --> 09:03.800
You really know how to push my buttons.

126
09:03.800 --> 09:05.350
Alright, alright.

127
09:05.350 --> 09:09.860
You two start bickering the moment you open your mouths.

128
09:11.800 --> 09:13.360
Chang Xuan,

129
09:13.360 --> 09:16.920
if you really have feelings for Miss Zi Yi,

130
09:16.920 --> 09:19.475
it's best to settle things early.

131
09:19.475 --> 09:24.693
No wonder people say that women love playing matchmaker.

132
09:25.060 --> 09:27.630
They simply can't bear to see a man stay single.

133
09:27.630 --> 09:30.860
Sounds like he hasn't settled down yet.

134
09:30.860 --> 09:34.166
Chang Xuan, are you interested in another girl?

135
09:44.100 --> 09:46.913
Could it be that she was right?

136
09:48.007 --> 09:51.540
It's so early in the morning, and you're already being so sharp-tongued.

137
09:52.240 --> 09:53.320
I'm leaving.

138
09:53.320 --> 09:54.964
- Where are you going? - The General Staff.

139
09:54.964 --> 09:56.923
You're going there dressed like that?

140
09:56.923 --> 09:58.340
Who are you trying to fool?

141
10:01.180 --> 10:02.700
None of your business.

142
10:03.260 --> 10:05.537
Then you'd better give your driver a heads-up.

143
10:05.537 --> 10:09.180
Make sure he doesn't take you to Xiangxi Hotel or Yuchun Opera Troupe again.

144
10:09.180 --> 10:11.660
You'd be a laughingstock.

145
10:11.660 --> 10:13.700
[Yuchun Opera House]

146
10:14.780 --> 10:17.180
♪ Drowsy blossoms ♪

147
10:17.180 --> 10:25.320
♪ Caught the edge of my dress ♪

148
10:25.320 --> 10:29.160
Have you heard? Feng the Fang wiped out over 2,000 bandits in one go.

149
10:29.160 --> 10:32.601
That old fellow is the talk of the army again.

150
10:33.420 --> 10:35.310
Commander-in-Chief held a celebration for him.

151
10:35.310 --> 10:36.680
My father took me along.

152
10:36.680 --> 10:39.060
That guy is so full of himself.

153
10:39.060 --> 10:41.580
When my father toasted him, he actually ignored him.

154
10:41.580 --> 10:43.080
That's just how he is.

155
10:43.080 --> 10:45.477
My father was smart. He didn't go at all.

156
10:45.477 --> 10:47.360
Yesterday, I went riding in Qingshui Town.

157
10:47.360 --> 10:50.520
On my way back, a group of refugees surrounded my car, begging for food.

158
10:50.520 --> 10:52.644
I had no guards with me. I was terrified.

159
10:52.644 --> 10:54.489
Are you watching the opera or not?

160
10:54.489 --> 11:00.480
♪ Like flowers, hearts lean toward the light ♪

161
11:00.480 --> 11:04.177
I must say, Ye Ping Jun has proved quite useful.

162
11:04.177 --> 11:05.777
You really should thank her.

163
11:05.777 --> 11:08.460
She suffered a lot because of you.

164
11:08.460 --> 11:09.660
What do you mean?

165
11:09.660 --> 11:11.310
I just came from Master Jin's place.

166
11:11.310 --> 11:13.800
He said they're delivering medicine to Ye Ping Jun.

167
11:13.800 --> 11:17.021
Apparently, she's on leave with a high fever.

168
11:17.900 --> 11:20.650
If you hadn't kept her on the boat with you all night,

169
11:20.650 --> 11:22.559
she wouldn't have fallen ill, would she?

170
11:22.559 --> 11:27.370
- Bravo! - Bravo!

171
11:30.320 --> 11:33.193
[Little West House, Yu's Mansion]

172
11:41.720 --> 11:43.240
I'll play along with you.

173
11:43.240 --> 11:46.890
But you can't just shorten the contract by six months.

174
11:46.890 --> 11:50.420
Once it's over, you must return the contract to me.

175
11:50.420 --> 11:52.180
Seven.

176
11:52.180 --> 11:53.553
Eight.

177
11:54.159 --> 11:55.679
Nine.

178
11:58.940 --> 12:00.253
Ten.

179
12:27.600 --> 12:29.499
She's just a little girl.

180
12:53.100 --> 12:54.565
Hello.

181
12:54.565 --> 12:56.800
Is this Ye Ping Jun's home?

182
12:56.800 --> 12:59.660
Yes, I'm her mother. And you are...

183
12:59.660 --> 13:01.637
Hello, ma'am. My surname is Yu.

184
13:01.637 --> 13:03.660
I'm Ping Jun's colleague.

185
13:03.660 --> 13:06.360
I heard she's sick, so I came to see her.

186
13:06.360 --> 13:09.095
Thank you for taking care of Ping Jun.

187
13:09.095 --> 13:10.240
It's the least we could do.

188
13:10.240 --> 13:13.717
The boss asked me to bring these cordyceps and ginseng.

189
13:13.717 --> 13:15.260
Boil them or soak them in water,

190
13:15.260 --> 13:16.920
they're good for the lungs.

191
13:16.920 --> 13:19.750
Ping Jun mentioned that your lungs have been bothering you.

192
13:19.750 --> 13:21.600
You can take some from time to time.

193
13:21.600 --> 13:23.323
You're being too kind.

194
13:23.323 --> 13:25.240
These gifts are too expensive.

195
13:25.240 --> 13:27.240
We can't accept them. Please take them back.

196
13:27.240 --> 13:30.106
It's fine. They're just a token from the boss.

197
13:32.620 --> 13:33.947
Ping Jun.

198
13:33.947 --> 13:35.620
Why are you here?

199
13:35.620 --> 13:38.426
The boss is worried about you. Are you feeling better?

200
13:38.426 --> 13:40.666
He sent me to check on you.

201
13:45.019 --> 13:47.220
He's very thoughtful.

202
13:47.220 --> 13:50.919
But if he weren't always causing trouble, I wouldn't have gotten sick.

203
13:52.880 --> 13:54.880
Watch your tone.

204
13:54.880 --> 13:57.360
Mr. Yu, please excuse her.

205
13:57.360 --> 13:58.684
It's alright.

206
13:58.684 --> 14:02.120
I admire Miss Ye's straightforward nature.

207
14:08.100 --> 14:13.340
I'd like to invite you for tea, but we don't have any fine tea to offer.

208
14:13.340 --> 14:14.469
It's fine.

209
14:14.469 --> 14:16.260
I happen to be a bit thirsty.

210
14:19.240 --> 14:22.720
Ping Jun, make some tea for Mr. Yu.

211
14:22.720 --> 14:23.880
But I...

212
14:23.880 --> 14:26.240
Go on, hurry up.

213
14:26.240 --> 14:27.539
Go.

214
14:31.020 --> 14:32.319
Go now.

215
14:34.840 --> 14:37.259
Well, Mr. Yu, please come inside.

216
14:39.720 --> 14:40.720
Come with me.

217
14:42.220 --> 14:43.921
Mr. Yu, please have a seat.

218
14:53.600 --> 14:55.080
Thank you, Miss Ye.

219
14:56.320 --> 14:58.999
Ping Jun, sit down.

220
15:01.880 --> 15:03.640
We are a humble family.

221
15:03.640 --> 15:05.377
I'm afraid we can't offer you much.

222
15:05.377 --> 15:06.937
Mr. Yu, please have some tea.

223
15:06.937 --> 15:08.300
Not at all.

224
15:08.300 --> 15:10.888
I can tell yours is a scholarly family.

225
15:10.888 --> 15:13.280
You sent Miss Ye to Mingde Girls' School.

226
15:13.280 --> 15:16.713
It's clear you value your daughter's education.

227
15:20.380 --> 15:22.439
How pretentious.

228
15:24.120 --> 15:28.100
Ma'am, I smelled a wonderful aroma as I came in.

229
15:28.100 --> 15:29.460
Are you cooking?

230
15:29.460 --> 15:32.306
Yes, it'll be ready soon.

231
15:32.795 --> 15:33.980
It's just a simple meal.

232
15:33.980 --> 15:38.400
If you don't mind, Mr. Yu, please stay and join us for dinner.

233
15:38.400 --> 15:41.084
Mr. Yu is usually very busy.

234
15:41.084 --> 15:42.960
He doesn't have time to linger here.

235
15:42.960 --> 15:45.384
As it happens, I'm free today.

236
15:45.384 --> 15:47.348
I came specifically to see you.

237
15:47.348 --> 15:49.300
Didn't expect to be invited to dinner as well.

238
15:49.300 --> 15:51.200
Hope I'm not bringing you too much trouble.

239
15:51.200 --> 15:53.779
Not at all. Dinner will be ready soon.

240
16:04.240 --> 16:05.366
You.

241
16:05.820 --> 16:08.705
Find an excuse right now to get out of dinner.

242
16:08.705 --> 16:09.825
Get out.

243
16:10.900 --> 16:12.164
Are you kicking me out?

244
16:12.164 --> 16:13.820
Isn't it obvious?

245
16:18.040 --> 16:23.420
It seems you don't want this anymore.

246
16:35.780 --> 16:38.500
I doubt you're doing this out of kindness.

247
16:40.132 --> 16:44.684
I heard you were sick, so I made a special trip to bring it to you.

248
16:44.684 --> 16:46.684
If you don't want it, I'll take it back.

249
17:22.420 --> 17:23.819
I'm a man of my word.

250
17:24.760 --> 17:28.861
From today on, you have no further ties with Xiangxi Hotel.

251
17:31.480 --> 17:33.900
Since I got the agreement,

252
17:33.900 --> 17:36.713
Master Chang Xuan, please leave.

253
17:39.780 --> 17:42.144
Ping Jun, come help me serve the food.

254
17:42.144 --> 17:44.493
Ma'am, let me help you.

255
17:54.920 --> 17:56.220
Uncle.

256
17:58.780 --> 18:03.420
What brings you here today, sweetheart?

257
18:03.420 --> 18:04.720
Uncle.

258
18:04.720 --> 18:07.819
Every time you see me, you tease me.

259
18:09.120 --> 18:10.320
Tell me.

260
18:10.320 --> 18:14.360
What have you set your sights on that you want me to buy for you?

261
18:14.360 --> 18:15.780
Look at what you're saying.

262
18:15.780 --> 18:18.280
Can't I simply miss you?

263
18:18.280 --> 18:20.590
I even made a special trip to see you.

264
18:20.590 --> 18:24.819
How could I not know what's in that little head of yours?

265
18:24.819 --> 18:28.060
I've watched you grow up since you were a little girl.

266
18:29.800 --> 18:35.080
Actually, I want to ask you for one thing.

267
18:35.080 --> 18:39.557
Is it rubies and emeralds this time, or a mink coat and Western dress?

268
18:39.557 --> 18:40.786
Neither.

269
18:41.113 --> 18:43.486
I've set my eyes on your land on Mount Changping.

270
18:45.680 --> 18:47.580
Mount Changping?

271
18:50.880 --> 18:52.260
That won't be easy.

272
18:52.659 --> 18:56.840
I've already agreed to sell the land to Tongbao Corporation.

273
18:56.840 --> 18:59.890
It's just a promise, not a signed contract.

274
18:59.890 --> 19:02.071
Just tell them it's no longer for sale.

275
19:02.880 --> 19:06.160
Please, say yes.

276
19:06.160 --> 19:09.559
Uncle, please? Uncle?

277
19:10.360 --> 19:12.320
These are just simple dishes.

278
19:12.320 --> 19:14.510
Mr. Yu, I hope you don't mind.

279
19:14.510 --> 19:15.680
This is quite a feast already.

280
19:15.680 --> 19:20.557
Besides, only simple food reveals its true flavor.

281
19:20.557 --> 19:21.980
Then please, try some.

282
19:21.980 --> 19:23.160
After you, ma'am.

283
19:23.860 --> 19:25.126
Alright.

284
19:36.000 --> 19:37.580
It's delicate and delicious.

285
19:37.580 --> 19:39.337
The flavor lingers beautifully.

286
19:39.337 --> 19:41.259
You're a wonderful cook, ma'am.

287
19:41.259 --> 19:43.759
Eat more if you like it.

288
19:49.820 --> 19:51.690
Try that one as well.

289
19:51.690 --> 19:55.111
- It's-- - Mom, let me get you some soup.

290
19:55.920 --> 19:58.520
Mr. Yu, that one is tasty too.

291
19:58.520 --> 20:01.020
It's a glutinous rice ball filled with meat.

292
20:01.020 --> 20:03.140
- The main... - Mom, drink this while it's hot.

293
20:03.140 --> 20:07.146
Alright. Serve a bowl of soup to Mr. Yu too.

294
20:19.060 --> 20:20.900
Thank you, Miss Ye.

295
20:32.960 --> 20:36.860
Finish your soup and leave.

296
20:42.059 --> 20:45.580
No wonder my mother says daughters are caring.

297
20:45.580 --> 20:51.013
Seeing the bond between you two warms my heart.

298
20:52.020 --> 20:54.280
Ping Jun is so close to you,

299
20:54.280 --> 20:57.720
she must tell you everything.

300
20:58.859 --> 21:00.079
Yes.

301
21:00.079 --> 21:02.119
Ping Jun and I have always relied on each other.

302
21:02.119 --> 21:05.299
Big or small, she tells me everything.

303
21:07.900 --> 21:12.900
By the way, I still don't know why Ping Jun fell ill.

304
21:13.840 --> 21:18.100
I heard she didn't come home that night.

305
21:22.720 --> 21:25.470
Ping Jun told me about that.

306
21:25.470 --> 21:29.819
The costumes weren't ready that day, and the troupe changed the play last minute.

307
21:29.819 --> 21:34.946
They needed the script in a hurry, so she had to work through the night.

308
21:38.660 --> 21:40.460
That must have been hard.

309
21:41.200 --> 21:43.059
She's been working so hard.

310
21:53.060 --> 21:55.020
This mantou smells wonderful.

311
21:55.020 --> 21:56.463
What is it made of?

312
21:56.463 --> 21:58.660
Have you never seen it before?

313
21:58.660 --> 22:00.259
This isn't mantou.

314
22:00.259 --> 22:02.920
It's wotou made from cornmeal.

315
22:05.059 --> 22:08.620
Seeing how much Ping Jun enjoys it, I'd like to try one myself.

316
22:08.620 --> 22:09.860
Go ahead, have one.

317
22:34.519 --> 22:37.099
Mr. Yu, are you choking?

318
22:40.720 --> 22:42.466
Here, have some soup.

319
22:49.460 --> 22:50.859
Feeling better?

320
23:03.860 --> 23:05.480
How is it, Master Chang Xuan?

321
23:05.480 --> 23:07.200
Are you feeling better now?

322
23:07.200 --> 23:08.546
What are you trying to say?

323
23:11.079 --> 23:13.279
What I want to say is,

324
23:13.279 --> 23:15.160
we're from different worlds,

325
23:15.160 --> 23:16.904
so it's best we go our separate ways.

326
23:16.904 --> 23:20.600
But I think experiencing new things

327
23:20.600 --> 23:23.539
and meeting new people is rather interesting.

328
23:24.560 --> 23:27.806
Our chat today has made me reluctant to leave.

329
23:28.175 --> 23:31.320
Since things between us are settled,

330
23:31.320 --> 23:34.025
I hope you can keep your promise.

331
23:34.025 --> 23:35.906
Don't disturb my life again.

332
23:41.000 --> 23:42.580
Nanhuai City isn't that big.

333
23:42.580 --> 23:44.420
We'll see each other again.

334
23:44.420 --> 23:46.140
Please don't.

335
23:46.140 --> 23:47.600
Master Chang Xuan.

336
23:47.600 --> 23:50.804
I hope that we can go our separate ways.

337
23:50.804 --> 23:53.259
Let's have nothing more to do with each other.

338
24:05.660 --> 24:07.613
Excuse me, sir.

339
24:11.100 --> 24:12.760
[To Ye Ping Jun]

340
24:12.760 --> 24:14.280
This is for Ye Ping Jun.

341
24:16.460 --> 24:18.440
Look at this stamp. Is it from overseas?

342
24:18.440 --> 24:22.320
It's from her fiancé, Jiang Xue Ting.

343
24:22.320 --> 24:24.240
They've been writing to each other for four years.

344
24:24.240 --> 24:26.901
One letter every two weeks, without missing a single one.

345
24:28.240 --> 24:29.793
Fiancé?

346
24:34.900 --> 24:37.120
Don't tell her you saw me. Deliver the letters as usual.

347
24:50.519 --> 24:54.380
Ping Jun, what did Xue Ting say in the letter?

348
24:55.240 --> 24:56.660
He said he's doing well.

349
24:56.660 --> 24:58.020
He told us not to worry about him.

350
24:58.020 --> 25:00.440
And he'll be back in autumn.

351
25:00.440 --> 25:01.917
- Really? - Yes.

352
25:01.917 --> 25:03.380
That's wonderful.

353
25:09.800 --> 25:13.505
Ping Jun, that Mr. Yu just now...

354
25:13.505 --> 25:16.425
He must be someone of high status.

355
25:19.200 --> 25:22.700
His surname is Yu. Which Yu is it?

356
25:23.480 --> 25:26.800
There aren't many Yu families in Nanhuai City.

357
25:26.800 --> 25:30.960
There's only one prominent Yu family.

358
25:30.960 --> 25:32.960
Could it be?

359
25:34.960 --> 25:36.559
Yes.

360
25:37.320 --> 25:39.420
The very one you're thinking of.

361
25:40.759 --> 25:44.019
How did you get involved with the Yu family?

362
25:44.840 --> 25:47.079
Mom, don't overthink it.

363
25:47.079 --> 25:49.320
I used to work at the Xiangxi Hotel.

364
25:49.320 --> 25:52.500
It was there that I met Master Yu.

365
25:56.180 --> 25:57.546
Ping Jun.

366
25:58.220 --> 26:01.400
For a humble family like ours,

367
26:01.400 --> 26:04.046
all we want in life is to live in peace and security.

368
26:04.580 --> 26:08.424
The Yu family is not to be messed with.

369
26:08.424 --> 26:11.460
It's best not to get mixed up with them.

370
26:11.460 --> 26:14.466
Lest we bring trouble upon ourselves.

371
26:15.460 --> 26:18.259
Mom, I understand.

372
26:18.259 --> 26:20.040
I've already quit my job.

373
26:20.040 --> 26:22.660
From now on, I'll have nothing to do with him.

374
26:22.660 --> 26:24.219
Please don't worry.

375
26:34.180 --> 26:38.017
It's from her fiancé, Jiang Xue Ting.

376
26:38.017 --> 26:39.940
They've been writing to each other for four years.

377
26:39.940 --> 26:42.700
One letter every two weeks, without missing a single one.

378
26:47.080 --> 26:50.200
Since things between us are settled,

379
26:50.200 --> 26:52.833
I hope you can keep your promise.

380
26:52.833 --> 26:54.853
Don't disturb my life again.

381
26:59.359 --> 27:00.593
Master Chang Xuan.

382
27:04.400 --> 27:07.946
Why are you drinking alone?

383
27:08.653 --> 27:10.480
State your business, or get out.

384
27:10.480 --> 27:13.960
I do have business. And it's good news.

385
27:15.560 --> 27:17.499
Look at this.

386
27:19.580 --> 27:22.500
It's from Miss Zi Yi. A belated birthday gift.

387
27:22.500 --> 27:24.160
All the paperwork is done.

388
27:24.160 --> 27:26.864
From today on, this land is yours.

389
27:26.864 --> 27:27.864
What do you think?

390
27:30.700 --> 27:33.240
[Seller: Tang Ji Qiu] [Buyer: Yu Chang Xuan]

391
27:38.520 --> 27:41.826
Do you really only want to build a racetrack?

392
27:41.826 --> 27:42.945
Take a guess.

393
27:44.580 --> 27:46.200
I think it's...

394
27:46.200 --> 27:47.686
Never mind.

395
28:12.120 --> 28:14.240
[Yu's Mansion]

396
28:17.259 --> 28:18.700
Commander.

397
28:18.700 --> 28:21.080
Look at how you're frowning.

398
28:21.080 --> 28:22.920
Put those papers away.

399
28:22.920 --> 28:25.259
Soak your feet to relieve the fatigue.

400
28:26.059 --> 28:27.359
Okay.

401
28:43.860 --> 28:46.692
The alliance involves many parties.

402
28:46.692 --> 28:48.200
Didn't we agree?

403
28:48.200 --> 28:50.680
No talking about business in my room.

404
28:51.819 --> 28:56.320
If you mention the alliance or official documents again,

405
28:56.320 --> 28:58.093
I'll ignore you.

406
29:00.960 --> 29:02.160
Alright.

407
29:02.839 --> 29:03.980
I won't mention it.

408
29:04.740 --> 29:06.441
That's more like it.

409
29:07.200 --> 29:11.680
Nothing matters more than a good night's sleep.

410
29:13.380 --> 29:14.560
There.

411
29:17.320 --> 29:18.320
Done.

412
29:20.920 --> 29:22.250
Careful.

413
29:28.060 --> 29:32.320
[Route 1: Head west / Route 2: Head south] [The real route: Via Weiling]

414
29:43.900 --> 29:45.740
I knew you'd still be here.

415
29:47.780 --> 29:51.880
Third Madam, it's only been a few days since you took this begonia from my place.

416
29:51.880 --> 29:53.800
I can't believe it's back already.

417
29:53.800 --> 29:56.000
Don't tease me.

418
29:56.000 --> 29:59.919
It was fine yesterday, but it's wilted this morning.

419
30:05.300 --> 30:06.533
You've overwatered it.

420
30:06.533 --> 30:09.200
The roots are waterlogged, so they can't breathe.

421
30:09.200 --> 30:10.800
Luckily, you brought it in time.

422
30:10.800 --> 30:12.197
Leave it with me for now.

423
30:12.197 --> 30:14.697
Once it's healthy again, you can come and get it.

424
30:16.900 --> 30:21.472
Newspapers! Get your newspapers here!

425
30:21.472 --> 30:23.880
Let's not beat around the bush.

426
30:23.880 --> 30:26.160
The land on Mount Changping is already yours.

427
30:26.160 --> 30:27.640
You've got what you wanted.

428
30:27.640 --> 30:30.580
From now on, leave Zi Yi alone.

429
30:32.259 --> 30:34.480
Why would you say that, Uncle Tao?

430
30:35.380 --> 30:37.753
I truly want to be with Zi Yi.

431
30:39.200 --> 30:44.920
Everyone knows you frequent brothels and theaters.

432
30:44.920 --> 30:49.680
Your sweet talk might fool my naive daughter,

433
30:49.680 --> 30:51.720
but you expect me to believe you're sincere?

434
30:51.720 --> 30:53.326
Are you sincere at all?

435
30:59.160 --> 31:02.361
Whether I'm sincere or not, words alone prove nothing.

436
31:07.620 --> 31:09.340
Take a look at this first.

437
31:19.140 --> 31:20.280
[Accounts]

438
31:21.240 --> 31:22.979
Where did you get this?

439
31:22.979 --> 31:24.593
It doesn't matter.

440
31:25.819 --> 31:29.940
What matters is that

441
31:30.726 --> 31:32.866
Mou Lin Sen also has a copy of this.

442
31:34.420 --> 31:37.540
Your business has grown significantly over the years.

443
31:37.540 --> 31:39.137
Mistakes are bound to happen.

444
31:39.137 --> 31:44.319
But Mou Lin Sen has been secretly collecting evidence that could get you killed.

445
31:45.640 --> 31:51.380
Do you think he wants to help you or have you at his mercy?

446
31:53.780 --> 31:58.140
Yu Chang Xuan, you're quite something.

447
31:58.140 --> 32:00.920
I really underestimated you before.

448
32:00.920 --> 32:02.740
You flatter me, Uncle Tao.

449
32:02.740 --> 32:05.019
You've dominated the business world for years.

450
32:05.019 --> 32:08.839
I'm being sincere with you today because I seek a long-term partnership.

451
32:09.535 --> 32:12.180
Mou Lin Sen and I have known each other for years,

452
32:12.180 --> 32:14.812
yet he still stabbed me in the back.

453
32:14.812 --> 32:17.173
How can I trust you?

454
32:18.819 --> 32:22.440
Friendships can change, but interests endure.

455
32:22.440 --> 32:26.723
Dongze and Beihai, the two largest docks,

456
32:26.723 --> 32:29.220
will be under the Tao family's control.

457
32:29.220 --> 32:32.020
All profits will go into your pocket.

458
32:32.020 --> 32:34.784
As long as it's within the jurisdiction of the Yu Army,

459
32:34.784 --> 32:39.166
whether it's banks, docks, or postal services,

460
32:40.139 --> 32:44.978
the Tao family will have priority and the most favorable operating terms.

461
32:47.140 --> 32:48.519
And what about this?

462
32:48.519 --> 32:49.579
Take it away.

463
32:52.180 --> 32:55.039
You certainly know how to make a deal.

464
32:55.039 --> 32:59.839
From now on, whatever happens between the Yus and Mous,

465
32:59.839 --> 33:03.880
you always manage to play both sides and stay out of the fray.

466
33:04.519 --> 33:06.640
The young generation is truly formidable.

467
33:09.680 --> 33:12.226
However, there is one condition

468
33:13.280 --> 33:17.086
that forms the foundation of our cooperation.

469
33:17.940 --> 33:19.440
Please, go ahead.

470
33:19.440 --> 33:21.800
My daughter, Zi Yi, is the apple of my eye.

471
33:21.800 --> 33:25.199
I've cherished her since she was little. She's never known a day's hardship.

472
33:25.199 --> 33:28.459
In the future, you must not fail her.

473
33:33.039 --> 33:34.480
Of course.

474
33:38.120 --> 33:40.919
The Chu and Yu families have set the date for their formal alliance.

475
33:42.040 --> 33:45.406
Yu Zhong Quan will depart on schedule.

476
33:46.420 --> 33:48.079
Which route will he take?

477
33:54.940 --> 33:56.633
Via Weiling?

478
33:59.760 --> 34:02.419
Old Devil Yu is indeed cautious.

479
34:02.419 --> 34:04.219
He's taking an unusual path.

480
34:04.900 --> 34:06.684
We must be careful.

481
34:06.684 --> 34:09.952
Last time, Liao Dong Feng took the fall.

482
34:09.952 --> 34:13.953
Next time, we might not be so lucky.

483
34:14.440 --> 34:15.940
Don't worry.

484
34:17.659 --> 34:20.099
This time, it will be foolproof.

485
34:21.079 --> 34:22.380
Miss Zi Yi.

486
34:31.540 --> 34:34.813
The servants told me, but I couldn't believe it.

487
34:35.187 --> 34:39.546
What brings you to my door today?

488
34:40.620 --> 34:41.960
I've come to thank you.

489
34:46.280 --> 34:48.379
You think a bouquet is enough?

490
34:48.665 --> 34:53.426
Do you know how much that land on Mount Changping is worth?

491
34:56.820 --> 34:58.260
What if I add this?

492
35:06.220 --> 35:09.699
Master Chang Xuan, you're always calling women "darling" and "precious."

493
35:09.699 --> 35:14.539
Your gifts are always the same, either pearls or gemstones.

494
35:14.539 --> 35:16.846
I picked this out just for you.

495
35:18.120 --> 35:22.497
You and that little lover of yours spent the night on a boat together, alone.

496
35:22.497 --> 35:24.539
I won't let that go that easily.

497
35:24.539 --> 35:26.460
How can you say we were alone?

498
35:26.460 --> 35:28.381
Wasn't the boatman there too?

499
35:31.340 --> 35:32.806
You're just twisting words.

500
35:33.360 --> 35:36.519
You think a bit of sweet talk will make me forgive you?

501
35:37.480 --> 35:39.239
Forgive me?

502
35:39.740 --> 35:42.240
Miss Zi Yi, the way you talk...

503
35:43.540 --> 35:48.486
Are you trying out the girlfriend role already?

504
35:50.860 --> 35:52.500
Oh, please.

505
35:52.500 --> 35:54.100
Master Chang Xuan,

506
35:54.100 --> 35:57.060
one moment it's a famous, glamorous actress.

507
35:57.060 --> 36:00.100
The next moment, it's a meek and sensible student.

508
36:00.100 --> 36:04.764
And then, it's those seductive "snake spirits"

509
36:04.764 --> 36:07.380
from the opera stage.

510
36:07.919 --> 36:10.040
I can't compete with them.

511
36:11.980 --> 36:14.699
Miss Zi Yi, why belittle yourself?

512
36:15.260 --> 36:18.820
Mayor Zhang's son is a great waltz dancer.

513
36:19.540 --> 36:23.360
President Zhao's nephew returned from studying abroad,

514
36:23.360 --> 36:26.733
playing both the piano and violin.

515
36:26.733 --> 36:30.793
Aren't these men all at your beck and call?

516
36:32.980 --> 36:35.624
All these young gentlemen...

517
36:35.624 --> 36:39.659
Miss Zi Yi, you handle them all so well.

518
36:42.520 --> 36:46.240
Look, I spend all day among women,

519
36:46.240 --> 36:49.733
while you spend all day among men.

520
36:49.733 --> 36:54.673
In Nanhuai City, could there be a better-matched pair?

521
36:56.920 --> 37:01.424
If you put it that way, I suppose we're evenly matched.

522
37:01.424 --> 37:03.313
Two of a kind.

523
37:31.580 --> 37:34.540
[Alliance Day]

524
38:03.559 --> 38:05.199
This is bad! Ambush!

525
38:10.039 --> 38:11.546
Back up!

526
38:22.080 --> 38:23.641
Protect the Commander-in-Chief!

527
38:42.140 --> 38:43.301
Commander-in-Chief!

528
38:44.400 --> 38:46.000
Rui Tong, why are you here?

529
38:46.000 --> 38:47.953
Chang Xuan sent me with reinforcements.

530
38:48.260 --> 38:49.620
Go! I'll cover you!

531
38:49.620 --> 38:51.540
- Commander-in-Chief, follow me! - Move!

532
38:57.880 --> 38:59.586
Throw the grenades!

533
39:37.280 --> 39:38.457
Commander-in-Chief.

534
39:38.457 --> 39:40.440
Chang Xuan is waiting in the tent.

535
39:41.320 --> 39:43.260
- This way, please. - Let's go.

536
39:51.540 --> 39:53.100
Commander-in-Chief, this way.

537
39:58.260 --> 40:00.666
Brigade Commander Kuang, please wait outside.

538
40:01.180 --> 40:04.640
Rui Tong, are you trying to stop me?

539
40:04.640 --> 40:08.800
Chang Xuan ordered that no one is allowed inside except the Commander.

540
40:08.800 --> 40:11.686
Bing Wen, wait outside.

541
40:23.680 --> 40:24.866
Father.

542
40:45.700 --> 40:48.166
This is your favorite, Phoenix Dancong tea.

543
40:53.340 --> 40:54.599
Chang Xuan.

544
40:55.500 --> 41:00.780
I must thank you for saving me and arranging everything so thoroughly.

545
41:05.460 --> 41:06.946
It was Mou Lin Sen.

546
41:07.606 --> 41:10.132
He sent men to ambush you on the road today.

547
41:10.492 --> 41:11.733
He wanted to kill you.

548
41:12.580 --> 41:13.941
That bastard.

549
41:16.700 --> 41:18.640
How did you find out?

550
41:20.780 --> 41:23.880
There's one more thing I'd like to ask you.

551
41:24.520 --> 41:29.164
Mou Lin Sen tried to assassinate me to sabotage the Chu-Yu alliance.

552
41:29.164 --> 41:32.123
But now, the alliance is still on.

553
41:33.239 --> 41:35.840
I want to know his next move.

554
41:37.580 --> 41:40.599
No wonder that land on Mount Changping is yours now.

555
41:40.599 --> 41:45.139
The racetrack was just a front to win over Tao Xi Li.

556
41:45.900 --> 41:48.139
Nothing escapes your eyes, Father.

557
41:50.260 --> 41:53.353
What's with those men in black outside?

558
41:55.260 --> 41:56.686
They're soldiers from the Cheng Army.

559
41:56.686 --> 41:58.086
The Cheng Army?

560
41:59.020 --> 42:03.044
They are outlaws by origin, always driven by profit.

561
42:03.044 --> 42:05.716
They even fought us over Dongshan.

562
42:05.716 --> 42:07.060
Why would they help you?

563
42:07.060 --> 42:10.980
I provided the intelligence, and Yang Shi Ying provided the troops.

564
42:10.980 --> 42:15.660
Together, we intercepted the arms smuggled by the Mou and Tao families.

565
42:15.660 --> 42:17.300
We split the loot evenly.

566
42:17.300 --> 42:19.005
I did him such a huge favor,

567
42:19.005 --> 42:21.260
so he lent me some of his men in return.

568
42:21.260 --> 42:24.390
As long as interests align, everyone gets what they need.

569
42:24.390 --> 42:28.020
We can work with whether it's the Cheng or Northwest Army.

570
42:38.559 --> 42:43.993
It seems I've failed miserably as a father.

571
42:45.039 --> 42:48.699
I can't believe I never truly knew my own son.

572
42:54.699 --> 42:56.000
Speak.

573
42:56.720 --> 42:59.420
What's your purpose for bringing me here?

574
43:02.260 --> 43:03.500
First,

575
43:04.500 --> 43:06.539
I want you to cancel the alliance.

576
43:14.540 --> 43:16.440
Cancel the alliance?

577
43:20.040 --> 43:21.446
Your reason?

578
43:21.446 --> 43:24.200
You agreed to ally with Chu Wen Fu

579
43:24.200 --> 43:29.500
because you want to use his power to impress Master Cheng

580
43:29.500 --> 43:34.040
and use that as a stepping stone into the central government's inner circle.

581
43:35.040 --> 43:37.486
Since you see things so clearly,

582
43:38.020 --> 43:44.360
you should know this alliance is imperative.

583
43:44.360 --> 43:48.960
But what you don't know is that the position in the central government

584
43:49.760 --> 43:52.566
that Chu Wen Fu promised you is just an empty promise.

585
43:57.219 --> 43:59.146
What makes you say that?

586
44:07.240 --> 44:10.880
This is Chu Wen Fu's Huaishan battle plan written for Master Cheng,

587
44:10.880 --> 44:12.684
along with the army reorganization plan.

588
44:12.684 --> 44:15.852
Not a single word about the Yu Army.

589
44:15.852 --> 44:19.155
He's been deceiving everyone and plotting behind your back.

590
44:19.155 --> 44:22.860
This way, he can legitimately deploy our elite forces

591
44:22.860 --> 44:24.420
and claim them as his own.

592
44:24.420 --> 44:27.037
When the time comes, he'll have you lead the charge

593
44:27.037 --> 44:31.437
while he reaps all the rewards behind the scenes.

594
44:35.099 --> 44:41.500
Chu Wen Fu's mediocre soldiers cannot help you achieve your political ambitions.

595
44:41.500 --> 44:44.746
Our Yu Army must grow strong on its own

596
44:45.060 --> 44:49.020
to avoid being crushed or devoured by others.

597
44:54.840 --> 44:56.920
If I don't agree,

598
44:58.820 --> 45:02.660
are you planning to keep me detained here?

599
45:02.998 --> 45:04.186
Yes.

600
45:13.720 --> 45:18.159
This is the agreement to cancel the alliance and order all troops back to their posts.

601
45:18.159 --> 45:22.320
And this is the appointment for the 9th Corps's new commander.

602
45:22.320 --> 45:24.026
I'll trouble you, Commander-in-Chief.

603
45:29.080 --> 45:35.046
